# "Any number" includes fewer than all (CR 701.3a): with Lightning Greaves and Lavaspur Boots on the battlefield Bot1
# chooses only the Boots, and the Greaves stay unattached. Mother of Runes is 4/3 (+1/+0 from the Boots) with haste.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mother of Runes
Lightning Greaves
Lavaspur Boots
Battlefield Improvisation
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mother of Runes.Cast
